Package: smrnorway
Title: Standardized Mortality Ratio Against the Norwegian General Population
Version: 1.0.0
Description: Scripts and functions to compute standardized mortality ratios
    (SMR) comparing a study cohort with the Norwegian general population using
    Statistics Norway life-table rates (StatBank 07902), with exact Lexis
    person-time expansion, exact Poisson (Garwood) confidence intervals, and
    forest-plot visualization. This is a script collection, not an installable
    package; DESCRIPTION is provided for dependency documentation.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.0)
Imports:
    data.table
Suggests:
    ggplot2
